//@ filecheck:
// `llvm-cov` sums the branches of a record and of its expansions, so the expansions carry none: the
// record of a modifier keeps the branch regions and the MC/DC regions of its body, counted over all
// its expansions, and one code region over its header. Its decision lists the IDs of the decision
// in each expansion, `f` and `g`, whose test vectors share one structure. The records of `f` and
// `g` have no decisions.
// CHECK: "name": "A.sol:M.both(uint256,bool)",
// CHECK: "decisions": [
// CHECK-NEXT: {
// CHECK-NEXT: "expansions": [
// CHECK-NEXT: 0,
// CHECK-NEXT: 1
// CHECK-NEXT: ],
// CHECK-NEXT: "conditions": 2,
// CHECK: "name": "A.sol:M.f(uint256,bool)",
// CHECK-NOT: "decisions"
// CHECK: "name": "A.sol:M.g(uint256,bool)",
// CHECK-NOT: "decisions"
// A modifier that nothing invokes owns no counters either. Its decision sums no expansions, so
// none of its vectors ran, and its conditions count `0 - 0`, expression 0, whose two zeros never
// ran but are not folded, as two zero counts would be.
// CHECK: "name": "A.sol:M.unused(uint256,bool)",
// CHECK: "counters": [
// CHECK-NEXT: {{[0-9]+}},
// CHECK-NEXT: 0
// CHECK-NEXT: ],
// CHECK: "expressions": [
// CHECK-NEXT: [
// CHECK-NEXT: 0,
// CHECK-NEXT: 0
// CHECK-NEXT: ]
// CHECK-NEXT: ],
// CHECK: 272,
// CHECK-NEXT: 10,
// CHECK-NEXT: 0
// CHECK: 272,
// CHECK-NEXT: 5,
// CHECK-NEXT: 2,
// CHECK-NEXT: 2,
// CHECK-NEXT: 0,
// CHECK-NEXT: -1,
// CHECK-NEXT: 1
// CHECK: "decisions": [
// CHECK-NEXT: {
// CHECK-NEXT: "expansions": [],
// CHECK-NEXT: "conditions": 2,
{
  "language": "Solidity",
  "sources": {
    "A.sol": {
      "content": "contract M {\n    modifier both(uint256 a, bool b) {\n        require(a > 1 && b);\n        _;\n    }\n\n    function f(uint256 x, bool b) external both(x, b) {}\n\n    function g(uint256 x, bool b) external both(x, b) {}\n\n    modifier unused(uint256 a, bool b) {\n        require(a > 1 && b);\n        _;\n    }\n}\n"
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "metadata": {
      "appendCBOR": false
    },
    "solar": {
      "unstable": [
        "instrument-coverage",
        "coverage-mcdc"
      ]
    },
    "outputSelection": {
      "*": {
        "*": []
      }
    }
  }
}
